Direct Livepeer Ethereum management

Usage:
  livepeer-chain [flags]
  livepeer-chain [command]

Available Commands:
  account      Read the sender's ETH balance and pending nonce
  completion   Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  earnings     Claim earnings and withdraw fees
  help         Help about any command
  orchestrator Manage orchestrator configuration
  round        Manage protocol rounds
  stake        Manage delegated stake
  status       Read the configured Ethereum chain status
  ticketbroker Manage ticket broker funds

Flags:
      --chain-id uint                   Optional expected RPC chain ID (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_CHAIN_ID)
  -c, --config string                    (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_CONFIG)
      --controller-address string       Livepeer Controller (Arbitrum mainnet) (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_CONTROLLER_ADDRESS) (default "0xd8e8328501e9645d16cf49539efc04f734606ee4")
  -k, --keystore-file string            Encrypted geth account JSON file (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_KEYSTORE_FILE)
      --keystore-password-file string   Owner-only file containing the exact keystore password bytes (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD_FILE)
  -m, --max-fee-per-gas string          Optional maximum transaction fee in wei per gas (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_MAX_FEE_PER_GAS)
  -o, --output string                    (default "text")
  -p, --print-config                    Print audited operator configuration and exit
      --rpc-url-file string              (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_RPC_URL_FILE)
      --sender string                    (env: LIVEPEER_CHAIN_SENDER)
  -h, --help                            help for livepeer-chain
  -v, --version                         version for livepeer-chain

Use "livepeer-chain [command] --help" for more information about a command.

Environment Variables:
  LIVEPEER_CHAIN_RPC_URL
